---
// Hero.astro
---
<section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden">

  {/* Multi-color ambient glow matching logo */}
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-primary/15 blur-[140px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-10 right-1/4 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-orange/10 blur-[140px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[600px] h-[300px] bg-brand-green/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">

    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-orange/10 border border-brand-orange/30 text-brand-orange text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold mb-6 sm:mb-8 animate-fade-in-up max-w-full">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-orange animate-pulse shrink-0"></span>
      <span class="truncate sm:whitespace-normal">The harsh truth about your local market...</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl font-heading font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-6 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
      Your Competitors Are Stealing <br class="hidden md:block"/>
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-primary via-brand-green to-brand-orange">Your Highest-Paying Clients.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-brand-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 animate-fade-in-up px-2 sm:px-0" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
      Right now, people in your city are searching for your exact services. If your website isn't engineered for conversion, you are literally handing cash to the other guys.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-4 animate-fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-orange w-full sm:w-auto text-lg px-8 py-4">
        Claim Your Free Strategy Audit
      </a>
      <a href="#audit" class="btn-secondary w-full sm:w-auto text-lg px-8 py-4">
        See Exactly Why You're Losing ↓
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
